OL,3,GNEWSALong delays affecting west
OL,4,AEdinburgh after City Bypass crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers on the Edinburgh City Bypass
OL,7,Fare experiencing long delays as the
OL,8,Froad remains closed more than 11 hours
OL,9,Fafter a crash.
OL,11,FThe accident happened between the
OL,12,FDreghorn and Hermiston Gait junctions
OL,13,Fabout 20:55 on Wednesday.
OL,15,FPolice Scotland have said they expect
OL,16,Fthe road to be closed for a number of
OL,17,Fhours more. Drivers across the west
OL,18,Fside of the capital have reported
OL,19,Fstandstill traffic and long delays.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
